export anchor ChromeStyle:
    number: 260
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Chrome
    idea: A dark brushed steel console where every control is a pill of polished liquid chrome with a hard horizon reflection, pressed tools sink into dark wells and one ice blue light marks focus.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #0c0d0f, the page and canvas edge
        steel: #1a1d21, brushed bars, the side panel and the style sheet
        steelRaised: #22262b, the comment card
        well: #0f1114, recessed fields, the tool tray and the people tray
        ink: #e9edf1, text on steel
        brushedGrey: #a3acb6, labels and meta
        chromeHigh: #f6f8fa, the chrome top highlight
        chromeMid: #d3d8de, the chrome upper body
        chromeHorizon: #8e959e, the hard reflection line at half height
        onChrome: #101215, text and icons on chrome
        ice: #6fd3ff, the pressed tool icon, status icons and focus
        statusGlass: #0a0d0f, the status readout with #b9e9ff text
        cobalt: #0a6fb0, the 32 px guide with white text
    type:
        Bahnschrift, DIN Alternate, Eurostile, Arial Narrow, system-ui for
        text and ui-monospace for values. Base 14px. The file name is 17px
        600, panel titles 18px 600, buttons 13px 700 caps tracked 0.06em,
        labels 12px caps tracked 0.08em, values 13px mono and the status
        readout 12px mono.
    layout:
        A brushed steel bar on top holds a chrome knob B, CANVAS · WEBSITE
        REDESIGN over Home v3, three chrome avatar buttons in a sunken tray, a
        sunken Present and a chrome Share ringed by a dark bezel. Below, the
        canvas fills the left and a 320px brushed side panel the right. Inside
        the canvas a sunken vertical tray holds six 50px round chrome tools,
        Move pressed into a black well with an ice icon, and a sunken 66%
        readout. The white Hero frame sits beside it with round chrome
        handles. A status readout runs under the canvas as a dark glass bar
        with a chrome bezel and pale blue mono text. The side panel holds
        Layers in a sunken tray, the Hero row a chrome pill with dark text and
        a SELECTED tag, then the Hero inspector as label rows, Position, Size,
        Fill, Vertical, Radius and Export, each with one or two sunken pill
        wells such as X 0, W 1440, Gap 32 and Fmt PNG, and a sunken Export
        Hero. The chrome gradient runs top to bottom through #f6f8fa, #d3d8de
        at 38 percent, #8e959e at 50 percent, #b9c0c8 at 72 percent,
        and #e4e8ec at the bottom. Below 860px the panels stack and the tool
        tray becomes a fixed horizontal tray at the bottom.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28px canvas padding, 18px panel padding, 8px between wells.
    density: Medium. Big chrome tools with compact layer and property rows.
    corners: Round everywhere. Circles for tools and handles, 17 to 19px pills for buttons and wells, 14px trays.
    borders: 1px dark edges under a 1px white top highlight, and panels part with a black line over a faint light line.
    shadows: Inset shadows sink wells and trays, chrome pills sit proud with a 2px drop, and Share has a double ring bezel.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.9px stroke, 18px. Selected is a circled check,
        Collapsed a right chevron, Saved a cloud with a check, always with the
        word.
    focus: A 2px ice blue outline offset 3px with a 12px ice glow.
    tone: Precise and technical with caps labels such as Position, Size and Export.
